---
export const prerender = true;
import "../styles/global.css";
---

<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />

<title>
  TotalSportek Intellectual Property Guidelines | Copyright & Rights
</title>

<meta
  name="description"
  content="Explore the TotalSportek guidelines for copyright and intellectual property matters, including ownership concerns, rights-holder requests, content-related notices, and general information about materials referenced across the website."
/>

<meta
  name="keywords"
  content="TotalSportek intellectual property guidelines, TotalSportek copyright policy, TotalSportek content rights, TotalSportek ownership matters, TotalSportek rights holder, TotalSportek legal information, copyright guidelines, intellectual property guidelines, rights holder request, content ownership information, copyright concerns, website rights policy"
/>

    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />

    <link
      href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Roboto:wght@300;400;500;600;700&family=Roboto+Condensed:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap"
      rel="stylesheet"
    />
  </head>

  <body class="bg-[#09090f]">
    <header class="bg-[#131320] border-b border-white/5">
      <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4">
        <div class="h-16 flex items-center justify-between gap-4">
          <a
            href="/"
            class="text-2xl font-bold text-[#f9fafb] hover:text-purple-400 transition whitespace-nowrap"
          >
            TotalSportek
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </header>

<div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 py-12 space-y-10">

<h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold mb-8 text-[#f9fafb]">
  TotalSportek Rights & Intellectual Property Guidelines | Copyright Information
</h1>


<div>
  <h2 class="text-xl text-white mb-2">
    Respect for Intellectual Property
  </h2>

  <p>
    TotalSportek acknowledges the importance of copyrights, trademarks,
    branding, creative works, and other forms of intellectual property.
    Ownership of protected material belongs to the individuals,
    organizations, companies, or other parties who hold the applicable
    rights. If a rights holder has a legitimate concern involving material
    referenced on the website, relevant details can be submitted for review.
  </p>
</div>


<div>
  <h2 class="text-xl text-white mb-2">
    Information Presented by TotalSportek
  </h2>

  <p>
    TotalSportek provides sports-related information intended to help
    visitors discover fixtures, competitions, teams, leagues, athletes,
    schedules, event details, and other sporting developments. Mentions of
    third-party teams, organizations, media companies, competitions, or
    protected works are provided for identification and informational
    context and do not indicate ownership of those materials by
    TotalSportek.
  </p>
</div>


<div>
  <h2 class="text-xl text-white mb-2">
    Names, Logos & Trademarks
  </h2>

  <p>
    Sports team names, league titles, logos, emblems, competition names,
    trademarks, and related visual elements belong to their respective
    owners. Such references may appear when describing or identifying a
    particular sport, organization, competition, or event. Their presence
    should not be interpreted as evidence of sponsorship, authorization,
    partnership, endorsement, or an official association with TotalSportek.
  </p>
</div>


<div>
  <h2 class="text-xl text-white mb-2">
    Rights-Related Requests
  </h2>

  <p>
    Copyright owners and authorized representatives who have a specific
    concern may contact TotalSportek with relevant information about the
    matter. A well-documented submission allows the issue to be identified
    more clearly and helps determine what information may be required for
    further consideration.
  </p>

  <ul class="list-disc pl-6 mt-4 space-y-2">
    <li>Full name of the rights owner or authorized representative</li>
    <li>Appropriate contact information</li>
    <li>Description of the protected work or material</li>
    <li>Specific TotalSportek page or reference involved</li>
    <li>Explanation of the reported intellectual property issue</li>
    <li>Details supporting ownership or authorization</li>
    <li>Statement confirming that the supplied information is accurate</li>
  </ul>
</div>


<div>
  <h2 class="text-xl text-white mb-2">
    Review of Intellectual Property Matters
  </h2>

  <p>
    Information submitted to TotalSportek may be assessed according to the
    circumstances and supporting details provided with the request. Where
    the available information does not sufficiently explain the concern,
    additional details or clarification may be requested before the matter
    can be evaluated further.
  </p>
</div>


<div>
  <h2 class="text-xl text-white mb-2">
    Providing Complete Information
  </h2>

  <p>
    Rights-related communications should be specific, understandable, and
    supported by relevant information whenever possible. Including clear
    descriptions, applicable records, ownership details, and accurate page
    references can make the communication easier to evaluate. Requests
    lacking sufficient context or reliable supporting information may be
    difficult to assess.
  </p>
</div>


<div>
  <h2 class="text-xl text-white mb-2">
    Contact for Rights Holders
  </h2>

  <p>
    Copyright owners, authorized agents, legal representatives, businesses,
    organizations, or other qualified parties may raise questions regarding
    intellectual property referenced through TotalSportek. Providing the
    relevant background and supporting information can assist in
    understanding the request and identifying the appropriate course of
    action.
  </p>
</div>


<div>
  <h2 class="text-xl text-white mb-2">
    Third-Party Ownership
  </h2>

  <p>
    Nothing in these guidelines changes or transfers intellectual property
    ownership belonging to another party. Copyrights, trademarks, service
    marks, logos, designs, names, symbols, and other protected interests
    remain with their respective rights holders. A third-party reference
    appearing within TotalSportek does not, by itself, establish that the
    associated material is owned by TotalSportek or that an official
    relationship exists between the parties.
  </p>
</div>
</div>
  </body>
</html>